# Compiled copies of the electron-vite config.
# 🔴 electron-vite resolves electron.vite.config.JS BEFORE .TS, so a stale compiled copy sitting
# here silently wins over the real config and the build uses settings nobody edited. A pair of
# these appeared on 08/10/2026 from a `tsc` run without --noEmit; they happened to be a faithful
# compile of the .ts, so nothing broke — which is exactly why it would not have been noticed.
electron.vite.config.js
electron.vite.config.d.ts
